    "title": "Offense powers playoff series win - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Clay Lilley ,\n7 hours ago The Big Sandy Wildcats opened the playoffs last weekend, sweeping a bi-district matchup against the Milano Eagles at the Willis High School. Game 1 was played Friday night in cold, rainy conditions, but the weather did little to slow Big Sandy’s offense. The Wildcats scored nine runs in the first inning on four singles, a double and six walks. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
